  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:360px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-yellowgreen pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Mental Assimilation</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/08/Si.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20130214152728\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Si\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/08/Si.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20130214152728\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/08/Si.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20130214152728 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/0/08/Si.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1032?cb=20130214152728 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Si\" width=\"270\" height=\"263\" data-image-key=\"Si.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Si.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Supreme Intelligence (Marvel Comics)</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Fuse several minds into one.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>assimilate and be composed by multiple minds all fuse into one</b>.&#160;Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Unimind\" title=\"Unimind\">Unimind</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMental_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Composite Mind Physiology</li>\n<li>Mental Unification</li>\n<li>Mind Fusion</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMental_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>User assimilates any mind of any sentient being and adds it to the users mind and enhancing their mental capabilities. By assimilating minds users own mind becomes more powerful and evolves to higher levels of power.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMental_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Experience_Absorption\" title=\"Experience Absorption\">Experience Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Knowledge_Absorption\" title=\"Knowledge Absorption\">Knowledge Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Memory_Absorption\" title=\"Memory Absorption\">Memory Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Absorption\" title=\"Mind Absorption\">Mind Absorption</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Divided_Mind\" title=\"Divided Mind\">Divided Mind</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mental_Evolution\" title=\"Mental Evolution\">Mental Evolution</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Gestalt_Form\" title=\"Gestalt Form\">Gestalt Form</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Gestalt_Mind\" title=\"Gestalt Mind\">Gestalt Mind</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Melding\" title=\"Mind Melding\">Mind Melding</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Hive\" title=\"Mind Hive\">Mind Hive</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Council\" title=\"Personal Council\">Personal Council</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Higher_Consciousness\" title=\"Higher Consciousness\">Higher Consciousness</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Superpower_Absorption\" title=\"Superpower Absorption\">Superpower Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Reactive_Adaptation\" title=\"Reactive Adaptation\">Reactive Adaptation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMental_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Collective_Entity_Physiology\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Collective Entity Physiology\">Collective Entity Physiology</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Manipulation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mind Manipulation\">Mental Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Absorption\" title=\"Mind Absorption\">Mind Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Telekinetic_Force_Manipulation\" title=\"Telekinetic Force Manipulation\">Telekinetic Force Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Unimind\" title=\"Unimind\">Unimind</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMental_Assimilation%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>May find hard to unify or fuse all assimilated minds together.</li>\n<li>May overload from assimilating too many minds.</li>\n<li>May not work against users of <a href=\"/wiki/Separation\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Separation\">Separation</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Anti_Storage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Anti Storage\">Anti Storage</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=